Package: drogonRtestbackend
Type: Package
Title: Test Backend for drogonR Native (C-ABI) Routes
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Minimal C-callable backend used by the drogonR test suite
    to verify the dr_get_cpp() / dr_post_cpp() native ABI without
    requiring an external dependency like ggmlR. Exposes a handful
    of trivial handlers (echo, content-type, status, headers,
    path-params) via R_RegisterCCallable so drogonR can resolve them
    with R_GetCCallable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
LinkingTo: drogonR
